  #ammo { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); }
  #armor { font-size: 15px; color: var(--blue); }
  #district { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  #radio { font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); }
  #nos-wrap { width: 200px; }
  #nos-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  #nos-bar { height: 8px; background: #2a3342; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  #nos-fill { height: 100%; width: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff7a1a, #ffb02e); transition: width 0.15s; }
  #heli-warn { display: none; font-size: 14px; color: #ff7a1a; font-weight: 700; }
  #hud-top-right { top: 14px; right: 14px; text-align: right; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-end; }
  #wanted { font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255,176,46,0.6); }
  #wanted.off { color: #3a4356; text-shadow: none; }
  #clock { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); }
  #objective { top: 14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); max-width: 560px; text-align: center; }
  #objective .obj-title { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber); }
  #objective .obj-text { font-size: 17px; margin-top: 2px; }
  #objective .obj-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  #minimap-wrap { left: 14px; bottom: 14px; }
  #minimap { width: 190px; height: 190px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background: #101623; display: block; }
  #speedo { right: 14px; bottom: 14px; text-align: right; font-family: var(--font-readout); }
  #speed { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; }
  #speed-unit { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  #hint { left: 50%; bottom: 16px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--panel); padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 8px; }
  #crosshair { left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); font-size: 22px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); text-shadow: 0 0 6px #000; display: none; }
  #toast { left: 50%; top: 96px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 2px 8px #000; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s; }
  #vignette { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 4; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 62%, rgba(180,20,20,0.45) 100%); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.4s; }
  .screen { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 10; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,12,20,0.55), rgba(8,12,20,0.88)); }
  .screen.hidden { display: none; }
  .panel { width: min(640px, 92vw); background: rgba(10, 15, 24, 0.92); border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,46,0.35); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 32px; }
  .panel h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--amber); }
  .panel h1 span { color: var(--ink); }
  .panel h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 26px; }
  .panel p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 8px 0; }
  .panel .story { color: var(--ink); }
  .panel .keys { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 14px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .panel .keys li b { color: var(--ink); }
  kbd { background: #232c3d; border: 1px solid #4a5568; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 6px; font-family: var(--font-readout); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  button { pointer-events: auto; cursor: pointer; background: var(--amber); color: #1a1200; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
  button.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
  button:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }
  #mission-list { margin: 10px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
  #mission-list li.done { color: var(--green); text-decoration: line-through; }
  #mission-list li.now { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; }
  #end-stats { font-family: var(--font-readout); font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="game" aria-label="Solmar Heist: an open-world crime game. Walk the city, steal cars, outrun the police, finish the jobs."></canvas>
<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<div id="vignette"></div>

<div class="hud" id="hud-top-left">
  <div class="chip" id="cash">$0</div>
  <div class="chip" id="health-wrap"><div id="health-label"><span>HEALTH</span><span id="health-num">100</span></div><div id="health-bar"><div id="health-fill"></div></div></div>
  <div class="chip" id="ammo">PISTOL &infin;</div>
  <div class="chip" id="armor">ARMOR 0</div>
  <div class="chip" id="nos-wrap"><div id="nos-label"><span>NOS</span><span id="nos-num">NOS 100%</span></div><div id="nos-bar"><div id="nos-fill"></div></div></div>
  <div class="chip" id="radio">&9834; SOLMAR FM 88.5</div>
</div>
<div class="hud" id="hud-top-right">
  <div class="chip" id="wanted">☆☆☆☆☆</div>
  <div class="chip" id="heli-warn">HELICOPTER OVERHEAD</div>
  <div class="chip" id="district">Solmar Bay</div>
  <div class="chip" id="clock">DAY 1 &middot; 08:00</div>
</div>
<div class="hud" id="objective">
  <div class="chip"><div class="obj-title" id="obj-title">FREE ROAM</div><div class="obj-text" id="obj-text">Explore Solmar Bay.</div><div class="obj-sub" id="obj-sub"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="hud" id="minimap-wrap"><canvas id="minimap" width="190" height="190"></canvas></div>
<div class="hud" id="speedo"><div id="speed">0</div><div id="speed-unit">MPH &middot; <span id="gear">ON FOOT</span></div></div>
<div class="hud" id="hint">WASD move &middot; E enter car &middot; Click shoot</div>
<div class="hud" id="crosshair">+</div>
<div class="hud" id="toast"></div>

<div class="screen" id="screen-title">
  <div class="panel">
    <h1>SOLMAR <span>HEIST</span></h1>
    <p class="story">Solmar Bay never sleeps, and neither do its debts. You are <b>Rae Vega</b>, a getaway driver
    who just burned her last crew. Fixer <b>Delia Voss</b> has eight jobs that pay enough to buy your way out —
    if the Solmar Bay Police Department — and its helicopter — does not catch you first.</p>
    <ul class="keys">
      <li><kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> Move / drive</li>
      <li><kbd>Mouse</kbd> Look (drag) &middot; <kbd>Click</kbd> Shoot</li>
      <li><kbd>E</kbd> Steal / exit car &middot; <kbd>Shift</kbd> Sprint / NOS in car</li>
      <li><kbd>Space</kbd> Jump &middot; <kbd>Space</kbd> Drift in car</li>
      <li><kbd>Q</kbd> Change radio station &middot; <kbd>R</kbd> Reload SMG</li>
      <li><kbd>P</kbd> Pause &amp; save &middot; <kbd>M</kbd> Sound &middot; <kbd>H</kbd> Honk</li>
      <li><kbd>1</kbd>–<kbd>4</kbd> Buy at the shop (armor / ammo / NOS / shotgun)</li>
      <li><kbd>E</kbd> at safehouse: repair, refill NOS, heal &amp; save</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Steal cars, lose the heat, finish all eight jobs across twelve named districts. Wanted stars rise when the city sees you do it.
    At four stars the SBPD helicopter comes for you. Save any time from the pause menu — progress, cash and completed jobs persist in this browser.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button id="btn-start" type="button">Start the story</button>
      <button id="btn-continue" type="button" class="ghost">Continue saved game</button>
      <button id="btn-freeroam" type="button" class="ghost">Free roam</button>
    </div>
    <ol id="mission-list"></ol>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="screen hidden" id="screen-pause">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Paused</h2>
    <p>Solmar Bay waits for no one — except right now.</p>
    <div id="pause-stats"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button id="btn-resume" type="button">Resume</button>
      <button id="btn-save" type="button" class="ghost">Save game</button>
      <button id="btn-quit" type="button" class="ghost">Quit to title</button>
    </div>
    <p id="save-note"></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="screen hidden" id="screen-end">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2 id="end-title">Busted</h2>
    <p id="end-text"></p>
    <div id="end-stats"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button id="btn-retry" type="button">Back on the streets</button>
      <button id="btn-end-title" type="button" class="ghost">Title screen</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

